                <pb facs="0721" n="603" sameAs="frus:frus1929v03/pg603"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.00/6428: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-10-17T13:00:00-05:45">October 17, 1929—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 2:08 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>254. My 244, October 4, noon. I understand that the Nicaraguans in reference were
                    refused entrance to Mexico and are proceeding to San Francisco.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
